  "messages": [
    {
      "text": "Two hosts sit on a curved orange couch in front of a window that is not a window. Behind the glass, a looped sunrise plays. It is raining outside the building."
    },
    {
      "text": "Good MORNING, Coldwater! It is six o'clock, it is four degrees, and you are ALIVE!"
    },
    {
      "text": "Statistically."
    },
    {
      "text": "Statistically alive! I'm Bijou Pace."
    },
    {
      "text": "Hal Dorn."
    },
    {
      "text": "And we have SUCH a show for you."
    },
    {
      "text": "First up — a heartwarming one. A Redline man has been reunited with his dog!"
    },
    {
      "text": "He has been reunited with a dog."
    },
    {
      "text": "He has been reunited with A dog, and honestly? At this hour, that's a win."
    },
    {
      "text": "The original dog remains outstanding."
    },
    {
      "text": "The original dog remains outstanding! Moving on!"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coldwater A.M. is brought to you by the people who would like you at work on time."
    },
    {
      "text": "A single induction ring on a laminate counter. Bijou stands behind it holding an unlabelled grey tube. Hal has not moved from the couch."
    },
    {
      "text": "Now — breakfast! Because the most important meal of the day is the one you can afford."
    },
    {
      "text": "Take your standard ration paste. Squeeze it into a pan. And here's the trick — heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the trick."
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the WHOLE trick, Hal. Two minutes, and it goes from grey to a sort of warmer grey."
    },
    {
      "text": "My father used to do that."
    },
    {
      "text": "Lovely! And if you've got a little sweetener, stir it through at the end and you have got yourself a TREAT."
    },
    {
      "text": "Curfew lifts at half six. South Gate is running long — they're searching everybody again."
    },
    {
      "text": "If you're heading in from the wastes, leave an hour. If you're carrying anything you'd rather not explain, leave it."
    },
    {
      "text": "Ha ha! Hal!"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm saying leave it at home. I'm saying that as a service."
    },
    {
      "text": "Haulage is slow on the Haul Road, the North Locks are frozen again, and the Basin is BEAUTIFUL this morning if you don't look directly at it."
    },
    {
      "text": "That's us! Back tomorrow, same couch, same sunrise."
    },
    {
      "text": "Same sunrise."
    },
    {
      "text": "Go and have a WONDERFUL day, Coldwater. You've earned it. Probably."
    },
